<p class="greeting">Hey <%= @first_name %>,</p>

<p class="body-text">Your identity verification call is booked<% if @starts_at %> for <strong><%= @starts_at.strftime("%A, %B %-d at %H:%M %Z") %></strong><% end %>.</p>

<p class="body-text"><strong>This call is not recorded.</strong> During the call a staff member takes one screenshot showing you and your document. It is kept with your case so a decision can be re-reviewed later without asking you to do this again.</p>

<p class="secondary-text">Have your document with you on the call — the reviewer will compare it against what you submitted.</p>

<p class="signature">— The Hack Club team</p>
